{"4243280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vector Rider", "steam_appid": 4243280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/a4a458832a1668a717e5ea5299cc70d5.poster.avif?t=1787409994\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/a4a458832a1668a717e5ea5299cc70d5.webm?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/a4a458832a1668a717e5ea5299cc70d5.mp4?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 <strong>DON’T FOLLOW THE TRACK. SURVIVE IT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vector Rider is a high-speed rocket sled traversal game where the world is broken, hostile, and trying to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no clean racing line.<br>No safe path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only what you can <strong>hold together at full speed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss the landing.<br>Hit the wrong surface.<br>Lose control for one second—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and it’s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/5c90c8cb6a4ca60805467c5e14615f60.poster.avif?t=1787409994\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/5c90c8cb6a4ca60805467c5e14615f60.webm?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/5c90c8cb6a4ca60805467c5e14615f60.mp4?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠 <strong>BUILD YOUR WAY THROUGH CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The route isn’t given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your drone to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >create paths through obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >recover impossible mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock risky shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >turn dead ends into escapes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best routes aren’t obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some feel like they shouldn’t work—<br>until you make them work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/e762ff6097d1da25655ae489f4e9537f.poster.avif?t=1787409994\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/e762ff6097d1da25655ae489f4e9537f.webm?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/e762ff6097d1da25655ae489f4e9537f.mp4?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌪 <strong>THIS WORLD FIGHTS BACK</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rough terrain throws you off balance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Structures block, catch, and betray you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazards punish hesitation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every surface changes your outcome</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not racing on a track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re <strong>surviving through a system that’s breaking apart around you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧱 <strong>RIDE ANYTHING. TRUST NOTHING.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut across:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unstable terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >narrow girders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >broken structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >off-track lines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safe paths exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paths are dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best paths feel illegal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛞 <strong>CONTROL THE EDGE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain jumps through chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover mid-air or crash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land anything — or lose everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn mistakes into survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can go fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staying alive at speed is the real skill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>FINISH FIRST. MASTER LATER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the objective however you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then come back to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >go faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >take riskier lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clean up your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >compete against ghosts and rivals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no perfect route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the one you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>IF YOU PLAY FOR THESE MOMENTS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I should not have made that.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“That wasn’t the intended path.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I turned a crash into a run.”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you already understand Vector Rider.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW — AND FIND YOUR WAY THROUGH</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/a4a458832a1668a717e5ea5299cc70d5.poster.avif?t=1787409994\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/a4a458832a1668a717e5ea5299cc70d5.webm?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/a4a458832a1668a717e5ea5299cc70d5.mp4?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 <strong>DON’T FOLLOW THE TRACK. SURVIVE IT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vector Rider is a high-speed rocket sled traversal game where the world is broken, hostile, and trying to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no clean racing line.<br>No safe path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only what you can <strong>hold together at full speed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss the landing.<br>Hit the wrong surface.<br>Lose control for one second—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and it’s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/5c90c8cb6a4ca60805467c5e14615f60.poster.avif?t=1787409994\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243280/extras/5c90c8cb6a4ca60805467c5e14615f60.webm?t=1787409994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">